        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEIRCODE: R14E685\n\nDNG McCormack Properties are privileged to present this wonderful 4 bedroom, 2 bath, detached home set on a generous c. 0.37 acre site, to the market. Recently refurbished throughout, this impressive property has been finished to an exceptionally high standard, offering a modern feel while retaining a warm and inviting character. Beautiful finishes, contemporary fittings and thoughtful design combine to create a home that is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nLocated in an enviable countryside setting, the property enjoys panoramic views of the surrounding countryside, with the stunning outlook needing to be seen to be truly appreciated. Internally, the property boasts bright and spacious accommodation, with a number of impressive features including double-height ceilings in both the sunroom and sitting room, along with beautiful exposed ceiling beams which add character and charm.\n\nThe recently refurbished modern kitchen is both stylish and practical, with excellent storage and a separate pantry providing additional space. Built-in storage has been thoughtfully incorporated throughout the ground floor, ensuring the home remains both functional and uncluttered.\n\nExternally, the property continues to impress. The mature, well-established gardens are enclosed by fenced boundaries and are complemented by mature trees and shrubs, creating a private and peaceful outdoor setting. The patio area, located directly off the kitchen, provides the perfect space for outdoor dining, entertaining guests or simply enjoying the beautiful surroundings during the warmer months.\n\nA further bonus of this wonderful property is the impressive selection of three separate outbuildings. The first offers an ideal space for a home gym, while the second, considerably larger building, provides endless possibilities and would be perfectly suited as a home office, studio, games room or home bar and entertaining space. The third building is a useful storage shed, ideal for garden equipment, tools and general storage requirements.\n\nThis superb location offers the best of both worlds, combining the peace and tranquillity of countryside living with excellent accessibility. Fishing is available close by, while the property also provides convenient access to Dublin via Castledermot, Carlow and Athy.\n\nA truly versatile and beautifully refurbished home offering generous living accommodation, fantastic outdoor space, stunning countryside views and excellent additional facilities.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this exceptional property has to offer.\n\nCall DNG McCormack Properties today to arrange your appointment to view on 059 913 3800."
      },
